<title>UK: Kleinwort hires retail analysts from Charterhouse.</title>
<headline>Kleinwort hires retail analysts from Charterhouse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kleinwort Benson Securities said it has hired the three-man retail industry research team from Charterhouse Tilney.</p>
<p>Robert Miller, Rod Salmon and Scott Ransley are joining Kleinwort, which lost its top rated retail team, led by Nick Hawkins, to rival Merrill Lynch about a month ago.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
